@page "/ecosystem"

<PageTitle>生态与社区 - Known Framework</PageTitle>

<SiteFrame Current="ecosystem">
    <section class="known-page-shell known-page-intro">
        <div class="known-page-heading">
            <span class="known-page-kicker">Ecosystem</span>
            <h1>把源码、文档、发布和社区入口做成真正可用的资源页</h1>
            <p>生态页负责承接用户下一步动作：看源码、读文档、安装包、进社区、了解版本节奏。</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="known-page-shell known-page-section">
        <div class="known-card-grid known-card-grid-4">
            <article class="known-card">
                <h3>官网</h3>
                <p>访问已部署站点了解整体产品信息。</p>
                <a class="known-inline-link" href="https://known.org.cn" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">known.org.cn</a>
            </article>
            <article class="known-card">
                <h3>GitHub</h3>
                <p>查看源码、分支、提交和协作记录。</p>
                <a class="known-inline-link" href="https://github.com/known/Known" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">github.com/known/Known</a>
            </article>
            <article class="known-card">
                <h3>Gitee</h3>
                <p>国内镜像与协作入口，适合网络环境受限场景。</p>
                <a class="known-inline-link" href="https://gitee.com/known/Known" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">gitee.com/known/Known</a>
            </article>
            <article class="known-card">
                <h3>NuGet</h3>
                <p>查看发布包与版本更新节奏。</p>
                <a class="known-inline-link" href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/Known" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">nuget.org/packages/Known</a>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="known-page-shell known-page-section">
        <div class="known-card-grid known-card-grid-2">
            <article class="known-card known-card-highlight">
                <span class="known-card-tag">Documentation</span>
                <h3>官方文档中心</h3>
                <p>文档内容直接读取仓库里的 Markdown 文件，站点内容和源码文档保持同源，适合持续迭代。</p>
                <div class="known-page-actions">
                    <a class="known-site-btn primary" href="/docs">进入文档中心</a>
                </div>
            </article>
            <article class="known-card known-card-highlight">
                <span class="known-card-tag">Community</span>
                <h3>交流与支持</h3>
                <p>围绕源码、版本发布和实践问题建立统一入口，方便开发者快速找到资源和沟通渠道。</p>
                <ul class="known-list">
                    <li>QQ群：865982686</li>
                    <li>GitHub Issues：问题反馈与建议</li>
                    <li>仓库示例：结合源码与文档学习</li>
                </ul>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="known-page-shell known-page-section known-page-cta-section">
        <div class="known-cta-card">
            <div>
                <span class="known-page-kicker">Get Started</span>
                <h2>如果你现在准备开始，先跑示例，再读文档</h2>
                <p>这是理解 Known 最快的方式，也是最接近真实项目落地路径的方式。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="known-page-actions">
                <a class="known-site-btn primary" href="/start">查看快速开始</a>
                <a class="known-site-btn" href="/docs">阅读文档</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</SiteFrame>
